msgstr ""

msgid "SMTP provides various way to use TLS:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"StartTLS: The client connects to the server using a plain connection and "
"then upgrades to a secure connection."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"SSL/TLS: The client connects to the server using a secure connection from "
"the start."
msgstr ""

msgid "Configuring STARTTLS"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To use `STARTTLS`, you need to configure the `start-tls` property to "
"`REQUIRED` or `OPTIONAL` and set `tls` to `false`:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Setting `tls` to `false` ensure we connect using a plain connection and then "
"upgrade to a secure connection using `STARTTLS`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To configure the trust store, you can use a _named_ TLS configuration stored "
"in the xref:./tls-registry-reference.adoc[TLS registry]:"
msgstr ""

